TYPES.md §1, §7.2, WIRE.md §5.14: a length bound outside `Int` is E3201 and the refinement is dropped; a field whose type had a finding has its @json forms unjudged, so `@json(pairs:)` reports no missing finite bound (no E3316).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local record Pair {
  k: Int
  v: Int
}

local record R {
  stats: [Pair](..=99999999999999999999) = [] @json(pairs: ["dst{i}", "val{i}"])
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E3201]  a/a.canon:9:20
  99999999999999999999 does not fit Int

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
